      "content": "与《Towards better decoding and language model integration in sequence to sequence models》对比，分别说明两篇论文如何回答“Which models do they use for NMT?”与“What are the solutions proposed for the seq2seq shortcomings?”，并说明是否具有可比性。",
      "turn_id": "e995517f797142b4aaf474f1f021b1ca"
